 "summary": "Proof scripts are robust and readable: generic projection/reflection lemmas are proved from Mathlib combinators with explicit simp only / field_simp / module steps, and the frame-level facts are term-mode wrappers over them rather than re-expansions. The refactor removes the old `change`-based hand-rolled structures and replaces a 14-line cancellation in `q_sq_mul_pTransverse_self` with `projOrthogonal_pairing`; no proof exceeds ~10 lines and no step rests on undocumented definitional equality.",
